# Fungus1_06 on the fourth hanging platform (x 115.8, y 23.83): the swing that cuts vine 4 (Vine Platform (4), hit box x 116.41 to 116.77) and drops the Knight onto its Activated Plat at the acid (y 4.35). Planned by hk-walkplan room (--swing) with the run before it as the pre.
